{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050825 :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100866 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100688 :question/math-academy-id "e-4397" :question/problem "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if \n\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\nand\n\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{x}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot 2+3\\cdot 5 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 7\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot 5\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n\n$$\nA\\mathbf{x}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101136 :question/math-academy-id "q-13564" :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 4 \\\\ 8 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 4 \\\\ 8 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-6)\\cdot 2+4\\cdot 4 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 4 \\\\ 8 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 8\\cdot 2+(-5)\\cdot 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Ax=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101137 :question/math-academy-id "q-13566" :question/problem "What is $\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262621 :question/math-academy-id "q-126511" :question/problem "Find $Zx$ if \n$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 \\\\ 2 & -7\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 \\\\ 2 & -7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot 1+(-4)\\cdot (-1) \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 \\\\ 2 & -7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2\\cdot 1+(-7)\\cdot (-1)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Zx=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262622 :question/math-academy-id "q-126512" :question/problem "Find $Xy$ if \n$X=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 \\\\ -6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$y=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 \\\\ -6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot 9 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 \\\\ -6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ (-6)\\cdot 2+2\\cdot 9\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Xy=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269081 :question/math-academy-id "q-13555" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}7\\cdot 3+2\\cdot -2 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 2\\cdot 3+5\\cdot -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269085 :question/math-academy-id "q-13565" :question/problem "Find $Hn$ if \n$H=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$n=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-7)\\cdot -3+2\\cdot 2 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ 2\\cdot -3+(-5)\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Hn=\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269105 :question/math-academy-id "q-13629" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 5+1\\cdot 4 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 5\\cdot 5+(-3)\\cdot 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292869 :question/math-academy-id "q-275589" :question/problem "Find $Ha$ if\n$H=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$a=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n| $Ha=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4\\cdot 7+2\\cdot 3 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\cdot 7+6\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299698 :question/math-academy-id "q-318640" :question/problem "Compute the following:\n\n| $\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0\\cdot 5+11\\cdot (-1) \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot 5+2\\cdot (-1)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299699 :question/math-academy-id "q-318644" :question/problem "Compute the following:\n\n| $\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-7)\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-2) \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-34 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-34 \\\\ 5\\cdot 4+8\\cdot (-2)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-34 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-34 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388410 :question/math-academy-id "q-13560" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3\\cdot 2+4\\cdot 2 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 2\\cdot 2+6\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 16\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 16\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a 2x2 Matrix by a Column Vector"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100867 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100689 :question/math-academy-id "e-4398" :question/problem "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if \n\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\nand\n\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{x}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-3)\\cdot 1+1\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 0 \\\\ 2\\cdot 1+0\\cdot (-2)+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 1+(-2)\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3-2+0 \\\\ 2+0+0 \\\\ -1+4+0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101134 :question/math-academy-id "q-13557" :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -8 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101135 :question/math-academy-id "q-13558" :question/problem "What is $\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262743 :question/math-academy-id "q-127267" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -4 & -6 \\\\ -2 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -4 & -6 \\\\ -2 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}6\\cdot 2+(-4)\\cdot (-1)+(-6)\\cdot 2 \\\\ (-2)\\cdot 2+5\\cdot (-1)+2\\cdot 2 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 2+(-4)\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}12+4-12 \\\\ -4-5+4 \\\\ -2+4+2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299694 :question/math-academy-id "q-318606" :question/problem "Find $Nz$ if\n$N=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$z=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Nz=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Nz & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}(-8)\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,1\\cdot (-4) & + & 2\\cdot 2 \\\\ 3\\cdot 3 & + & (-6)\\cdot (-4) & + & 5\\cdot 2 \\\\ 4\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot (-4) & + & 7\\cdot 2\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}-24 & + & (-4) & + & 4 \\\\ 9 & + & \\,\\,\\,24 & + & 10 \\\\ 12 & + & (-8) & + & 14\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-24 \\\\ 43 \\\\ 18\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299695 :question/math-academy-id "q-318622" :question/problem "Compute the following:\n\n| $\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -3 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 8 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -3 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 8 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}-4\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6\\cdot (-1) & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot 4 \\\\ 5\\cdot 3 & + & (-3)\\cdot (-1) & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7\\cdot 4 \\\\ 1\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8\\cdot (-1) & + & (-2)\\cdot 4\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & + & (-6) & + & 8 \\\\ 15 & + & 3 & + & 28 \\\\ 3 & + & (-8) & + & (-8)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 46 \\\\ -13\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338758 :question/math-academy-id "q-70188" :question/problem "Find $By$ if \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$y=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 6+1\\cdot (-3)+1\\cdot 1 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot 6+2\\cdot (-3)+(-1)\\cdot 1 \\\\ 4\\cdot 6+0\\cdot (-3)+(-3)\\cdot 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}12-3+1 \\\\ -18-6-1 \\\\ 24-0-3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -25 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338759 :question/math-academy-id "q-70191" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0\\cdot 8+(-4)\\cdot 4+1\\cdot 2 \\\\ 1\\cdot 8+2\\cdot 4+(-3)\\cdot 2 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 8+2\\cdot 4+4\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0-16+2 \\\\ 8+8-6 \\\\ -8+8+8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345291 :question/math-academy-id "q-77349" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 1+(-4)\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 5 \\\\ 3\\cdot (1)+(-2)\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 5 \\\\ 5\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-2)+8\\cdot 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2+8+5 \\\\ 3+4+25 \\\\ 5+2+40\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ 32 \\\\ 47\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186392980 :question/math-academy-id "q-70190" :question/problem "Find $Lz$ if \n$L=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$z=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Lz & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot 8+4\\cdot 2 \\\\ 1\\cdot (-3)+3\\cdot 8+(-2)\\cdot 2 \\\\ 2\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot 8+(-5)\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3+0+8 \\\\ -3+24-4 \\\\ -6+0-10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 17 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186393667 :question/math-academy-id "q-77350" :question/problem "Find $Pv$ if \n$P=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$v=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Pv & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 4+2\\cdot (-1) \\\\ 1\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-1) \\\\ 1\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 4+4\\cdot (-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0-4-2 \\\\ 0-4-3 \\\\ 0-4-4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186393674 :question/math-academy-id "q-77351" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot (-2)+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 3 \\\\ (-2)\\cdot (-2)+2\\cdot (-1)+(-2)\\cdot 3 \\\\ 1\\cdot (-2)+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2+2+3 \\\\ 4-2-6 \\\\ -2+2+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a 3x3 Matrix by a Column Vector"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100868 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100690 :question/math-academy-id "e-4399" :question/problem "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if \n\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\nand\n\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{x}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}a\\cdot 3+c\\cdot 2 \\\\ b\\cdot 3+d\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a+2c \\\\ 3b+2d\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101115 :question/math-academy-id "q-127270" :question/problem "Find $By$ if \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}a & -a & a \\\\ a & -2b & b \\\\ 2a & -b & a\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$y=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =\\begin{bmatrix}a & -a & a \\\\ a & -2b & b \\\\ 2a & -b & a\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}a\\cdot 1+(-a)\\cdot (-1)+a\\cdot (-1) \\\\ a\\cdot 1+(-2b)\\cdot (-1)+b\\cdot (-1) \\\\ 2a\\cdot 1+(-b)\\cdot (-1)+a\\cdot (-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}a+a-a \\\\ a+2b-b \\\\ 2a+b-a\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}a \\\\ a+b \\\\ a+b\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101133 :question/math-academy-id "q-13554" :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262746 :question/math-academy-id "q-127276" :question/problem "Find $Mz$ if \n$M=\\begin{bmatrix}s & t \\\\ -t & s\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$z=\\begin{bmatrix}s \\\\ t\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Mz & =\\begin{bmatrix}s & t \\\\ -t & s\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}s \\\\ t\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}s\\cdot s+t\\cdot t \\\\ (-t)\\cdot s+s\\cdot t\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{s}^{2}+{t}^{2} \\\\ -st+st\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{s}^{2}+{t}^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262747 :question/math-academy-id "q-127277" :question/problem "Find $Qg$ if \n$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}m & 2m \\\\ -m & n\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$g=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Qg & =\\begin{bmatrix}m & 2m \\\\ -m & n\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}m\\cdot (-2)+2m\\cdot 3 \\\\ -m\\cdot (-2)+n\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2m+6m \\\\ 2m+3n\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4m \\\\ 2m+3n\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292871 :question/math-academy-id "q-275597" :question/problem "If \n$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}a & b & a \\\\ a & -b & a \\\\ 0 & 0 & a\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$r=\\begin{bmatrix}a \\\\ 0 \\\\ -a\\end{bmatrix},$\nfind $Qr.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Qr=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Qr & =\\begin{bmatrix}a & b & a \\\\ a & -b & a \\\\ 0 & 0 & a\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}a \\\\ 0 \\\\ -a\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot a & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,b\\cdot 0 & + & a\\cdot (-a) \\\\ a\\cdot a & + & (-b)\\cdot 0 & + & a\\cdot (-a) \\\\ 0\\cdot a & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\cdot 0 & + & a\\cdot (-a)\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}{a}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{a}^{2}) \\\\ {a}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{a}^{2}) \\\\ 0 & + & 0 & + & (-{a}^{2})\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -{a}^{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299690 :question/math-academy-id "q-318589" :question/problem "If \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}b & a & -b \\\\ -b & a & b \\\\ -b & 0 & -b\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x=\\begin{bmatrix}-b \\\\ 0 \\\\ b\\end{bmatrix},$\nfind $Ax.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Ax=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}b & a & -b \\\\ -b & a & b \\\\ -b & 0 & -b\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-b \\\\ 0 \\\\ b\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (-b) & + & a\\cdot 0 & + & (-b)\\cdot b \\\\ (-b)\\cdot (-b) & + & a\\cdot 0 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,b\\cdot b \\\\ (-b)\\cdot (-b) & + & 0\\cdot 0 & + & (-b)\\cdot b\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}-{b}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{b}^{2}) \\\\ {b}^{2} & + & 0 & + & {b}^{2} \\\\ {b}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{b}^{2})\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2{b}^{2} \\\\ 2{b}^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299691 :question/math-academy-id "q-318591" :question/problem "If \n$P=\\begin{bmatrix}m & n & -m \\\\ m & -n & -m \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$u=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ p \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},$\nfind $Pu.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Pu=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Pu & =\\begin{bmatrix}m & n & -m \\\\ m & -n & -m \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ p \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}m\\cdot 1 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,n\\cdot p & + & (-m)\\cdot 1 \\\\ m\\cdot 1 & + & (-n)\\cdot p & + & (-m)\\cdot 1 \\\\ 0\\cdot 1 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot p & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\cdot 1\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}m & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,np & + & (-m) \\\\ m & + & (-np) & + & (-m) \\\\ 0 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2p & + & 0\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}np \\\\ -np \\\\ 2p\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299692 :question/math-academy-id "q-318595" :question/problem "Find $By$  if \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}6p & -4q \\\\ -5p & 2q\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$y=\\begin{bmatrix}p \\\\ q\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n| $By=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =\\begin{bmatrix}6p & -4q \\\\ -5p & 2q\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}p \\\\ q\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}6p\\cdot p & + & (-4q)\\cdot q \\\\ -5p\\cdot p & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2q\\cdot q\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6{p}^{2}-4{q}^{2} \\\\ -5{p}^{2}+2{q}^{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338765 :question/math-academy-id "q-70226" :question/problem "Find $Tu$ if \n$T=\\begin{bmatrix}x & y & x \\\\ x & -y & x \\\\ -x & -y & x\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$u=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ 0 \\\\ -x\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Tu & =\\begin{bmatrix}x & y & x \\\\ x & -y & x \\\\ -x & -y & x\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ 0 \\\\ -x\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}x\\cdot x+y\\cdot 0+x\\cdot (-x) \\\\ x\\cdot x+(-y)\\cdot 0+x\\cdot (-x) \\\\ (-x)\\cdot x+(-y)\\cdot 0+x\\cdot (-x)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{x}^{2}+0-{x}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2}+0-{x}^{2} \\\\ -{x}^{2}+0-{x}^{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2{x}^{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388403 :question/math-academy-id "q-13556" :question/problem "Find $By$  if \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}b & b \\\\ c & c\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$y=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =\\begin{bmatrix}b & b \\\\ c & c\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}b\\cdot 3+b\\cdot 4 \\\\ c\\cdot 3+c\\cdot 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3b+4b \\\\ 3c+4c\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7b \\\\ 7c\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564810 :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}a & 2c \\\\ 2b & 2d\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$." :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}a & 2c \\\\ 2b & 2d\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}a\\cdot 3+2c\\cdot 2 \\\\ 2b\\cdot 3+2d\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a+4c \\\\ 6b+4d\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564813 :question/problem "Find $Mz$ if \n$M=\\begin{bmatrix}s & 2t \\\\ -2t & s\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$z=\\begin{bmatrix}s \\\\ 2t\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Mz & =\\begin{bmatrix}s & 2t \\\\ -2t & s\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}s \\\\ 2t\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}s\\cdot s+2t\\cdot 2t \\\\ (-2t)\\cdot s+s\\cdot 2t\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}s^{2}+4t^{2} \\\\ -2st+2st\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}s^{2}+4t^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564815 :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}3a & 2c \\\\ b & 3d\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$." :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a & 2c \\\\ b & 3d\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a\\cdot 1+2c\\cdot 2 \\\\ b\\cdot 1+3d\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a+4c \\\\ b+6d\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564818 :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}2a & 3c \\\\ 2b & 2d\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$." :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}2a & 3c \\\\ 2b & 2d\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}2a\\cdot 3+3c\\cdot 2 \\\\ 2b\\cdot 3+2d\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}6a+6c \\\\ 6b+4d\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564839 :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ 2b & 2d\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$." :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ 2b & 2d\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}a\\cdot 2+c\\cdot 3 \\\\ 2b\\cdot 2+2d\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}2a+3c \\\\ 4b+6d\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564840 :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}3a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$." :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a\\cdot 1+c\\cdot 2 \\\\ b\\cdot 1+d\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}3a+2c \\\\ b+2d\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix With Variable Entries by a Column Vector"}] :topic/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column Vector"}
